    {"id": 21, "text": "Under Gilbert-Elliott: folding (0.31) is freshest vs. compression (0.39) and classical (0.49).", "poster_quote": "Under Gilbert-Elliott: folding (0.31) is freshest vs. compression (0.39) and classical (0.49)."},
